  <ul class="tick stakes" style="margin-top:28px">
   <li>Audit &amp; compliance findings (GMP, HACCP)</li>
   <li>Sanitation lapses</li>
   <li>Spoilage &amp; lost perishable inventory</li>
   <li>A changeover or new line launch that can’t start</li>
   <li>Overtime and burnout on your core team</li>
  </ul>`,
    spec: `<b>Elementor:</b> Heading · Text Editor · EK Icon List (2-col). Stakes follow the approved Food &amp; Beverage risk list; the changeover item extends its named situations. <b>No compliance outcome is promised — the page staffs the program, it doesn’t warrant the result.</b>`,
  },

