    <div class="blocknum">PROOF 02</div>
    <p style="margin:0">Engagements run as long as the gap does: published AFIMAC deployments range from multi-month assignments to a two-year manufacturing partnership.</p>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="note">Two short cards rather than a featured-case layout, because the 99-personnel case already leads on <a href="${u("/roles/forklift-operators")}">Forklift Operators</a> and <a href="${u("/roles/assemblers-production")}">Assemblers &amp; Production</a>. Here it evidences food-plant trust rather than headcount. <b>Link both to the pillar and match its published framing at build.</b></div>`,
